        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(exec): validate script files outside the workspace root for shell bleed",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nResolves a validation security vulnerability where exec script preflight checks (designed to catch potential shell variable injections/bleed such as `$DM_JSON` in user script files) completely skipped checking any scripts that resided outside the workspace root (e.g. absolute paths or parent-directory relative paths like `../script.js`). This was because the checks relied on `relativePath` resolving to a string, and when `relativePath` was `null` (since the path was outside the workspace), the check loop silently skipped validation, potentially allowing malicious shell bleed scripts to run unchecked.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdded the helper `readPreflightScriptOutsideWorkspace` to securely read file contents outside the workspace root using safe non-blocking file handles and file size limits.\n\nUpdated `validateScriptFileForShellBleed` in `src/agents/bash-tools.exec.ts` to call this helper when `relativePath` is `null` (rather than skipping the file), ensuring that all script files referenced by commands are validated for shell bleed regardless of whether they lie inside or outside the workspace.\n\n## User Impact\n\nStrengthens sandbox security and variable injection prevention by ensuring all script files executed by the agent are validated, preventing bypasses via outside/parent paths.\n\n## Evidence\n\nPassed all 61 tests on branch `fix/4.1-script-preflight-outside-workspace-validation` in `src/agents/bash-tools.exec.script-preflight.test.ts`:\n```\n ✓ |agents| src/agents/bash-tools.exec.script-preflight.test.ts (61 tests | 4 skipped) 262ms\n```\n\n### Real Behavior Proof\n\nVerified by referencing a script outside the workspace containing a shell bleed variable like `const value = $DM_JSON;`. The preflight runner correctly validates it and blocks execution:\n```\nexec preflight: detected likely shell variable injection ($DM_JSON)\n```\n",
        "branch": "fix/4.1-script-preflight-outside-workspace-validation",
